      "problem": "$\\frac{4{x}^{4}-2{x}^{3}-8{x}^{2}+3x+1}{2{x}^{2}-x-2}=$",
      "worked_solution": "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2{x}^{2}-2 \\\\  & 2{x}^{2}-x-2\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,4{x}^{4}-2{x}^{3}-8{x}^{2}+3x+1\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{4{x}^{4}-2{x}^{3}-4{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-4{x}^{2}+3x+1 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,4{x}^{2}+2x+4}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,x-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n- the quotient is $2{x}^{2}-2,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $x-3.$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\frac{4{x}^{4}-2{x}^{3}-8{x}^{2}+3x+1}{2{x}^{2}-x-2}=2{x}^{2}-2+\\frac{x-3}{2{x}^{2}-x-2}.\n$$",
